  "body": "If you are looking for a home with a little more flexibility, this one is well worth a look. Two masters, a single-level layout and elevated views are not something you often find together in Millwater. Better still, Bonair Park and Bonair Playground are just a 3-minute walk away.\r\n\r\nSet on a generous 514sqm elevated section, this 205sqm (approx.) home has been designed with family living in mind. The open-plan kitchen, dining and living area is spacious and welcoming, with the kitchen positioned at the centre of the home. There is plenty of storage and bench space, while large bifold doors open out to the deck and backyard, making the most of the elevated outlook. A separate living room gives you another space to relax, watch a movie or simply have some quiet time.\r\n\r\nThe two masters are what really set this home apart. One is positioned near the entrance and works particularly well for parents, guests or extended family. The main master is privately located at the other end of the home, with its own ensuite, walk-in wardrobe and access to the deck. Two further bedrooms are serviced by the family bathroom.\r\n\r\nOutside, the elevated section is easy to enjoy, with the deck and backyard providing a great spot for family time, entertaining or simply enjoying the outlook. The elevated position also gives the home a nice sense of space and privacy.\r\n\r\nThe location is very convenient too. With Bonair Park and Bonair Playground only a short walk away, plus KingsWay School, Silverdale Shopping Centre, local amenities and motorway access all close by, everyday living is easy.\r\n\r\nCome along to the open home or get in touch to arrange a private viewing.",
